          "parsed_datetime": "2026-03-13T20:16:24.122Z",
          "text": "Fresh off the heels of the Workday #SKO2026, we’re energized for the year ahead.\n\nConnecting with Workday leaders, industry peers, and likeminded ecosystem partners helps strengthen our unified efforts to bring financial wellness to employees everywhere. Looking ahead to what’s in store for our partnership in 2026. \n\nFor employers on Workday, delivering financial wellness to your workforce is simpler than ever through our partnership. Learn how:  https://lnkd.in/gxrk-dQr \n\n#Workday #ChimeWorkplace #FinancialWellness #FinancialHealth",
